"             \"metadata.url `sqlite:` is single-instance and needs the filesystem hosted store; \\","-             remove the `s3:` block or the metadata URL\"","-                .to_string(),","+             remove the `s3:` block or the metadata URL\",","         ));","     }","     Ok(MetadataBackend::Sqlite(resolve_relative(path, base_dir)))"," }"," ","+/// Whether `url` names a libSQL database: `libsql://`, or the HTTP a","+/// self-hosted `sqld` speaks.","+fn is_libsql_url(url: &str) -> bool {","+    [\"libsql://\", \"http://\", \"https://\"]","+        .iter()","+        .any(|scheme| {","+            url.get(..scheme.len())","+                .is_some_and(|prefix| prefix.eq_ignore_ascii_case(scheme))","+        })","+}","+","+/// libSQL metadata, which any hosted store can use: it is shared by every","+/// instance.","+fn libsql_metadata(","+    file: &MetadataFile,","+    url: &str,","+    base_dir: &Path,","+) -> Result<MetadataBackend, RegistryError> {","+    let settings = build_libsql_settings(","+        LibsqlFile {","+            url: url.to_string(),","+            auth_token: file.auth_token.clone(),","+            replica_path: file.replica_path.clone(),","+            sync_interval: file.sync_interval.clone(),","+            max_connections: file.max_connections,","+        },","+        base_dir,","+        \"metadata\",","+    )?;","+    if settings.replica_path.is_some() && settings.sync_interval_secs == Some(0) {","+        return Err(invalid(","+            \"metadata.syncInterval must be at least 1s with a replicaPath: it bounds how stale a \\","+             replica read may be\",","+        ));","+    }","+    Ok(MetadataBackend::Libsql(settings))","+}","+"," pub(crate) fn default_storage_string() -> String {","     \"./storage\".to_string()"," }"],"additions":116,"deletions":28,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/config/src/tests/storage.rs","lines":["@@ -364,3 +364,30 @@ fn a_metadata_url_is_refused_when_it_cannot_serve() {","         assert!(matches!(err, RegistryError::InvalidConfig { .. }), \"{yaml}: {err:?}\");","     }"," }","+","+#[test]","+fn a_libsql_url_carries_its_replica_settings_with_any_hosted_store() {","+    let yaml = \"storage: /s\\ns3:\\n  bucket: b\\nmetadata:\\n  url: libsql://db.example.turso.io\\n  \\","+                authToken: token\\n  replicaPath: ./replica.db\\n  syncInterval: 5s\\n\";","+    let config = Config::from_yaml_str(yaml, Path::new(\"/etc/pnpr\"), listen(), None).unwrap();","+    let crate::MetadataBackend::Libsql(settings) = config.storage.metadata else {","+        panic!(\"libSQL metadata, got {:?}\", config.storage.metadata);","+    };","+    assert_eq!(settings.url, \"libsql://db.example.turso.io\");","+    assert_eq!(settings.auth_token.as_deref(), Some(\"token\"));","+    assert_eq!(settings.replica_path, Some(PathBuf::from(\"/etc/pnpr/replica.db\")));","+    assert_eq!(settings.sync_interval_secs, Some(5));","+}","+","+#[test]","+fn libsql_settings_need_a_libsql_url_and_a_replica_needs_a_sync_interval() {","+    let stray = \"storage: /s\\nmetadata:\\n  url: sqlite:./m.db\\n  replicaPath: ./r.db\\n\";","+    let unbounded = \"storage: /s\\nmetadata:\\n  url: http://127.0.0.1:8080\\n  replicaPath: ./r.db\\n  \\","+                     syncInterval: 0s\\n\";","+    let no_url = \"storage: /s\\nmetadata:\\n  authToken: token\\n  replicaPath: ./r.db\\n\";","+    let with_documents = \"storage: /s\\nmetadata:\\n  backend: documents\\n  maxConnections: 4\\n\";","+    for yaml in [stray, unbounded, no_url, with_documents] {","+        let err = Config::from_yaml_str(yaml, Path::new(\"/\"), listen(), None).unwrap_err();","+        assert!(matches!(err, RegistryError::InvalidConfig { .. }), \"{yaml}: {err:?}\");","+    }","+}"],"additions":27,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpr/crates/error/src/lib.rs","lines":["@@ -398,14 +398,15 @@ pub enum RegistryError {","     #[cfg(feature = \"server\")]","     Bcrypt(bcrypt::BcryptError),"," ","-    ///